  "architecture_decision": "simple_crm.activity owns interactions, participant links, tasks, and append-only activity audit events. CRM-007 remains the owner of lead stage and assignment history. Quick-contact is the single transaction boundary for interaction, optional lead-stage update, next task, and audit event; activity services re-check CRM-005 action/scope authorization. Date-only source precision is retained as a nullable exact time rather than inventing timestamps.",
